# Agentix Orchestration System

- **CLI Tool**: `agx` (or `agentix`)
- **Roles**: `team-lead`, `design-engineer`, `backend-engineer`, `frontend-engineer`, `visual-qa`
- **Worktree Boundaries**: 
  - Backend changes in `../<project>-backend` (`agent/backend`)
  - Frontend changes in `../<project>-frontend` (`agent/frontend`)
  - Root workspace is for `main`, design system documentation, and visual QA
- **Visual QA**: Multi-viewport Playwright verification (`agx vqa -u <url>`)
- **Gates**: Discovery (Gate 1) -> Visual Direction (Gate 2) -> Design Tokens (Gate 3) -> Wireframes (Gate 4) -> Parallel PRs (Gate 5) -> Visual QA (Gate 6)

